    <main class="main mb-5" data-asc="78197" id="skipto">
        <div class="container">
                <h1 class="mainTitle msg">2026 General Election Sample Ballots</h1>
            <div class="row align-items-start">
                <section class="col-12 col-lg-8">
                        <div class="overview">
                            <div class="tXl">
                                <div>
                                  
                                    
<p>You may find the ballot(s) that correspond to your contest(s) by using either the PDF list or Excel lookup tool below. Each ballot type has both an English (E) and Spanish (S) version.</p>
                                </div>
        

                               
                                

                            </div>
                        </div>


                    <div id="AddressM" class="d-flex d-lg-none row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2">
